style.parallax.attribute.motionSmoothingHires=High Resolution
style.parallax.description.motionSmoothingHires=Whether this styleground's texture is drawn at six times the usual resolution (1920x1080 for a full screen instead of 320x180).\nMotion Smoothing's Fancy rendering mode then draws it at its own resolution rather than scaling a 320x180 one up, so it stays sharp.\nEverywhere else it is drawn scaled down to its normal size. The texture's width and height must both be multiples of 6.
